## 5. What remains open

Rust/Go structured error codes for capability `reason` and shell
connection failures - the last unimplemented piece of ADR 0004's original
scope. The demo-incidents.json investigation (§3) - separate from ADR
0004, tracked on its own. Once that investigation lands a trustworthy
regenerated fixture, `KNOWN_GAPS["page:incidents"]` and
`KNOWN_GAPS["wizard-step:5"]` in this scanner should both go empty and
can be deleted - the test will say so itself if they are ever left in
place after the gap actually closes.
